### How Is This Different from N-Queens?

| Aspect | Sudoku Solver | N-Queens |
|---|---|---|
| Grid size | Fixed 9x9 | Variable NxN |
| Values | Digits 1-9 | Queen placement |
| Constraints | Row + Column + 3x3 Box | Row + Column + Diagonals |
| Solutions | Usually one | Multiple for N >= 4 |
| Termination | First complete fill | First valid or all valid |

